An easy but still enjoyable platformer. Good to kill time, especially if you don't have much practice with platformers (like me) or is just plain bad at video games in general.
PROS:
-Free;
-Nice concept;
-Simple but pretty pixel graphics;
-Easy controls;
-Good to kill time.
CONS:
-The song gets repetitive after a while, but you can just turn it off on the main menu;
-The animation for the jumps is a bit off, but it's easy to ignore that as you progress.
-If you already have practice with platformers, this game might be a little too easy for you (it's free anyway).
Extra:
-The sound effect when the character dies made me giggle a bit ^^
Overall, a nice little game, I liked it :)

